#  Video contents-buffer proxy: when the <video> element's backing layer is
#  rebuilt (fullscreen enter/exit, navigation), the OLD GraphicsLayer's
#  teardown unbound the shared buffer proxy AFTER the new layer had bound
#  it, silently degrading video to the main-thread pending-buffer path
#  (~4fps on an idle fullscreen page). Guarded unbind: clear only if the
#  proxy still points at the caller's platform layer.
#
# ---
Video contents-buffer proxy: don't let a dying GraphicsLayer unbind the
proxy from its successor.

The media player's CoordinatedPlatformLayerBufferProxy outlives the
GraphicsLayer backing the <video> element. When the element's backing is
rebuilt (element fullscreen enter/exit, reparenting, page navigation reusing
the player), the NEW GraphicsLayerCoordinated binds the proxy to its platform
layer first, and the OLD layer is destroyed afterwards - and its destructor
(and the delegate/replacement paths) called setTargetLayer(nullptr)
unconditionally on the SHARED proxy, wiping the fresh binding.

From then on every decoded video frame takes the silent m_pendingBuffer path
(no per-frame CompositionReason::VideoFrame request), consumed only during
main-thread rendering updates. On an idle fullscreen page those run at timer
cadence (~4/s device-measured on YouTube 1080p fullscreen: rendering updates
p50 257ms while the compositor redrew the stale frame at 30fps) - the video
visibly plays at ~4fps. Inline playback masks the bug because page animations
keep the rendering-update rate at display cadence.

Fix: clearing paths go through clearTargetLayerIfEqual(expected), which
unbinds only if the proxy still points at the caller's platform layer.

--- a/Source/WebCore/platform/graphics/texmap/coordinated/CoordinatedPlatformLayerBufferProxy.h
+++ b/Source/WebCore/platform/graphics/texmap/coordinated/CoordinatedPlatformLayerBufferProxy.h
@@ -43,6 +43,7 @@
     ~CoordinatedPlatformLayerBufferProxy();
 
     void setTargetLayer(CoordinatedPlatformLayer*);
+    void clearTargetLayerIfEqual(CoordinatedPlatformLayer*);
     void consumePendingBufferIfNeeded();
     void setDisplayBuffer(std::unique_ptr<CoordinatedPlatformLayerBuffer>&&);
 
--- a/Source/WebCore/platform/graphics/texmap/coordinated/CoordinatedPlatformLayerBufferProxy.cpp
+++ b/Source/WebCore/platform/graphics/texmap/coordinated/CoordinatedPlatformLayerBufferProxy.cpp
@@ -68,6 +68,19 @@
     }
 }
 
+void CoordinatedPlatformLayerBufferProxy::clearTargetLayerIfEqual(CoordinatedPlatformLayer* layer)
+{
+    ASSERT(RunLoop::isMain());
+    Locker locker { m_lock };
+    if (m_layer != layer)
+        return;
+    m_layer = nullptr;
+    m_pendingBuffer = nullptr;
+#if ENABLE(VIDEO) && USE(GSTREAMER)
+    m_compositingRunLoop = nullptr;
+#endif
+}
+
 void CoordinatedPlatformLayerBufferProxy::consumePendingBufferIfNeeded()
 {
     ASSERT(RunLoop::isMain());
